      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的身上散發著密阿雷的氣息……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B376848EAB4E0A6563767C84575BC6963F96F776846C23606F2026202600100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "抱歉這麼唐突，\n但<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有帶著呆呆獸嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62B16B4990199EBC55107A81FF0C000A4F4600100003110000FF01014F6059B367095E36845754465446737855CEFF1F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在我住的伽勒爾地區，\n呆呆獸就是如<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳所見，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n有著黃色的腦袋瓜和尾巴。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572862114F4F76844F3D52D2723E57305340FF0C000A5446544673785C31662F598200100003110000FF01014F6059B36240898BFF0C00100001BE00000A670984579EC3827276848166888B74DC548C5C3E5DF4300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但聽說在別處是不一樣的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46807D8AAA572852258655662F4E0D4E006A237684300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且，最近在密阿雷\n可以遇見野生的呆呆獸對吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E14FF0C67008FD157285BC6963F96F7000A53EF4EE59047898B91CE751F76845446544673785C0D5427FF1F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "難得到這裡旅行了，\n我想和這邊的呆呆獸成為夥伴。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96E35F975230901988E165C5884C4E86FF0C000A621160F3548C9019908A7684544654467378621070BA59254F34300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有呆呆獸的話，就讓給我吧。\n我會把伽勒爾的呆呆獸給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B3670954465446737876848A71FF0C5C318B937D66621154273002000A62116703628A4F3D52D2723E76845446544673787D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B37684300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳擁有能在密阿雷市捉到的呆呆獸，\n就讓一隻給我吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B364C1670980FD57285BC6963F96F75E02634952307684544654467378FF0C000A5C318B934E0096BB7D6662115427300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意用密阿雷的呆呆獸\n跟我交換伽勒爾的呆呆獸嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F75285BC6963F96F77684544654467378000A8DDF62114EA463DB4F3D52D2723E768454465446737855CEFF1F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好！我們這就來交換吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597DFF016211501190195C314F864EA463DB5427300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "伽勒爾的呆呆獸\n在這邊應該是挺稀奇的喔？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F3D52D2723E7684544654467378000A57289019908A61C98A72662F633A7A00594776845594FF1F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想要的是在伽勒爾地區\n找不到的呆呆獸。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F389817684662F57284F3D52D2723E57305340000A627E4E0D52307684544654467378300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦哦！聞起來的氣味不同呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E654E6FF01805E8D774F8676846C2354734E0D540C5462300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說，牠未免也太大隻了吧！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAAFF0C7260672A514D4E5F592A592796BB4E865427FF01FF1F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我知道外表會不一樣，\n但我可沒聽說是這麼大一隻啊！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621177E590535916886867034E0D4E006A23FF0C000A4F46621153EF6C92807D8AAA662F90199EBC59274E0096BB554AFF01FF0100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呆？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5446FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是這呆～呆的臉……\n果然呆呆獸就是呆呆獸呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F90195446FF5E5446768481C920262026000A679C71365446544673785C31662F5446544673785462FF0100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意把貴重的呆呆獸給我，\n我真的很高興！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F628A8CB491CD76845446544673787D666211FF0C000A6211771F76845F889AD88208FF0100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說當牠進化成呆殼獸後，\n看起來會更不一樣。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8AAA7576726090325316621054466BBC73785F8CFF0C000A770B8D774F86670366F44E0D4E006A23300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "伽勒爾的呆殼獸啊，\n是毒屬性……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F3D52D2723E768454466BBC7378554AFF0C000A662F6BD25C6C60272026202600100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎啊！我就不多說了，\n到時候<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳親眼看看吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE554AFF0162115C314E0D591A8AAA4E86FF0C000A52306642501900100003110000FF01014F6059B389AA773C770B770B5427300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要好好寶貝\n伽勒爾的樣子的呆呆獸喔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981597D597D5BF68C9D000A4F3D52D2723E76846A235B5076845446544673785594FF0100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳把貴重的呆呆獸給我。\n要好好寶貝伽勒爾的樣子的呆呆獸喔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
